{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國影帝李政宰與私交甚篤的男星鄭雨盛，於2016年共同創立Artist Company事務所，目前李政宰持有27.1%股權，是公司最大股東，而持有10.99%股權的鄭雨盛則於本月2日，提早約半年辭去內部董事職務，但並未出售股份，目前仍是公司</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:24:38.288253+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T13:05:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T13:18:20.931369+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T13:18:20.931369+00:00","content_hash":"15f1e9d168253f55e34c35020dc726d3982f2bab75f155066d578900b0965c60","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}